Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 20)
Description: Shareable Docker container configuration providing multi-stage build and security rules
 @sebastienrousseau/docker-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
